{"id": "DdWpF8JPkh2", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"VIDEO\" to get the DaVinci Resolve MCP to start editing videos with Claude AI. \n\nYour AI can edit videos now, and not just simple stuff like captions and cuts.\n\nFull production grade edits.\n\nDaVinci Resolve, which is a free video editor on par with Premiere Pro, just dropped their official MCP.\n\nSo you can now connect it directly to Claude Code or Codex.\n\nAnd control your entire timeline just by chatting with it.\n\nWith it, you can automatically color grade your footage.\n\nBuild motion graphics.\n\nCreate multicam cuts.\n\nAdd sound effects.\n\nAnd adjust the music so it fits your edit perfectly.\n\nPlus if you need a B roll clip in between, you can have Claude generate it.\n\nAnd drop it straight into your timeline automatically.\n\nThink of it like having an editing assistant who never gets tired of doing the repetitive parts of your workflow.\n\nColor grading alone used to take hours of manual adjustment per project.\n\nNow it's just a conversation with your terminal.\n\n#DaVinciResolve #aivideoediting #claudecode #aimcp #aivideos", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789573783, "like_count": 5983, "comment_count": 9791, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1069829219300870a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.426, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNXG6Eq0cbykZQ-ukzbFhfhGMzYaHiJ6FZlCyNP_tBKPx1gQcYsP_WYYFhDUa0XHuv3yKtj1GeuZOYkFPhPNjI9Q6KKAGw7DHzgFEA.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdqGqa63TxrViy4abGY72VPdgTS0n3JF7HHc6VgmgKIZkClIESPeVOjWEmv7rx9L2Oc&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=g8L28pu9M-gQ7kNvwGHZiKj&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=F-AeRrDv-9IuvFZ8yWf2Dw&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQR0UZyCE